    "title": "Bubble Shooter Family",
    "description": "Bubble Shooter Family is a FREE Bubble Shooter puzzle games.\r\n\r\nThis game will give you a happy time with popping same-colored bubbles and save different family! In the shooter game, match 3 to blast and drop colorful balls. Enjoy hours of ball pop fun. Use the bubble shooter to collect gems, break pots, and more as you challenge a variety of levels! \r\n\r\nTreasure hunt in this bubble shooting puzzle game. Seek the secret by matching bubbles with the unique aiming line, it allows you to pop and blast! Shoot all the colored balls, Aim, match, and play carefully to pop bubbles and drop as many as possible!\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\n\u2728 Match 3 or more bubbles to make them pop in this magical puzzle shooting legend\r\n\u2728 Special boosters to help you pass those panda pop games\r\n\u2728 Create powerful boosters to pop more bubbles \r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\u2728 Hundreds of unique bubble shooter levels with various fun puzzle games!\r\n\u2728 Free bubble pop games! No internet!\r\n\u2728 4 bunny pop tools that help you win the bubble blast.\r\n\u2728 Many kinds of special balls in this bubble pop.\r\n\u2728 Amazing game effect about the toy blast!\r\n\r\nCONTACT US\r\nThanks for your selecting our logic puzzles! We will make the game even better.\r\nIf you encounter any puzzles' issues during the pop bubbles game, you can send us feedback via email.\r\nEmail: playfulbytesstudio@gmail.com\r\nTel: +12134684503\r\nEULA: https://sites.google.com/view/eulaofplayfulbytes/home\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/playful-bytes-pp/home",
